            "notes": "[No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) makes it possible to do a lot of healing or damage to tanks, or anyone, quickly, as with the item you'll be getting round 2 you won't need scope in much at all. \nI've tried multiple other powers as round 1 options, but this is the one I've had the most consistent success with. \n(TO NOTE: the description says \"landing unscoped shots\" but this doesn't include shields, and possibly barriers in general. Shooting at a shield won't increase your AS and will reset your bonus if you don't do direct healing/dps within the 2s window)\n\nI don't tend to go WP or AS items round 1, but you can if you want to. I mostly take [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) for the movement boost. It's small, but helps your mobility.\n\n(As a little reminder: any time [well, up to 15 times] you can get an enemy affected by sleep, even if they're immediately woken up, will be useful for you in round 5. Don't always use it on cooldown to the point you never have it, but getting some in when/where you can is good)",
