            "notes": "If you have at least 13k, then replace the green items with one of the blue optional ones. \n\nAs a note, it seems more people are starting to realize that [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) is especially good against an [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) with a burn build, but a lesser-known one is that [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) is effective against a melee [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) who's taken [Ambusher Optics](item_742c3c71-17cd-4fa7-bf18-ddeae7d521ca).\nGood items to consider taking on a per-game basis if those are the heroes/builds you're facing.",
