            "created_at": "2025-07-27T04:15:51.099217+00:00",
            "notes": "If you have 51k this round, swap [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) for [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8).\n\nThe other optional items are there if you want alternatives to switch out, [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) if you want to be extra tanky and [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) for extra dps/healing. \nDespite picking [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) last here, I honestly wouldn't swap the optional items out for that, but instead I'd take one of them instead of [Unscoped Resources](item_64c401f6-7508-4fc7-ac3a-93c9f3f57e2b). Personally, I just think that [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) mixed with [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) and the general high healing late round stadium has is just kinda too good to pass up. It could still work, but this build is focused on being tanky, and that's what makes you tanky. \n\nPersonally, I don't think that the upsides of [Unscoped Resources](item_64c401f6-7508-4fc7-ac3a-93c9f3f57e2b) are worth swapping in [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) *most* of the time. Before the 15% WP addition, [Unscoped Resources](item_64c401f6-7508-4fc7-ac3a-93c9f3f57e2b) wasn't even a consideration, but now that and the ability to (almost) never have to reload is great, and definitely worth 11k.",
